WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.512 --> 00:00:05.429
(people chatting softly in the background)

00:00:14.857 --> 00:00:16.132
(people gasp)

00:00:16.132 --> 00:00:21.132
(bomb detonates)
(people scream)

00:00:24.947 --> 00:00:29.947
(people continue screaming)
(sirens blaring)

00:00:40.455 --> 00:00:43.622
(spacecrafts blaring)

00:00:48.734 --> 00:00:52.210
- (whispers) Wait, wait, wait.

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:54.070
Gotta be careful here,

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:56.175
this place is crawling with them.

00:00:56.175 --> 00:00:57.520
(high-pitched whoosh)

00:00:57.520 --> 00:00:58.379
What was that?

00:00:58.379 --> 00:00:59.630
- What?

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:00.463
- Cover me

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:08.203
- Guys! Hey guys!

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:10.180
Hey guys!

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:11.013
Oh thank God!

00:01:11.868 --> 00:01:14.430
Yeah, we started a community of survivors.

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:17.745
Y'all come live with us.
(gun cocks)

00:01:17.745 --> 00:01:20.078
(gun fires)

00:01:21.627 --> 00:01:24.460
(gun fires again)

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.250
- Wait, how did you know?

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:33.110
- Come on.

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:36.200
Redneck wants us to
move into his community?

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:37.330
Us?

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:38.326
Let's go.

00:01:38.326 --> 00:01:39.326
- All right.

00:01:45.725 --> 00:01:46.558
(guns cock)

00:01:46.558 --> 00:01:48.633
- Guys! Over here!
(laughs hysterically)

00:01:48.633 --> 00:01:51.249
Oh thank god, there are other!

00:01:51.249 --> 00:01:52.853
- Would you let me date your daughter?

00:01:52.853 --> 00:01:53.840
- Of course!

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:56.520
(gun fires repeatedly)

00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:00.010
(cloaking crackling)

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:01.875
- Oh my god, oh my god,
oh my god! (screams)

00:02:01.875 --> 00:02:04.280
(guns cock)
Please don't hurt me!

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:06.700
My best friend's and I love Jay-Z!

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:09.407
And my favorite movie
is "Think Like a Man."

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:12.500
- She's good.
- Come with us.

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:13.800
- Okay.
- [Key] Stay close.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.080
- Okay.
- What's your name?

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:17.175
- Emily.
- (in unison) Of course it is.

00:02:17.175 --> 00:02:20.925
(dramatic suspenseful music)

00:02:24.299 --> 00:02:27.382
- Hey, hey! Don't shoot, don't shoot!

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:31.100
- What do you think about the police?

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:32.261
- Well, I love their third album.

00:02:32.261 --> 00:02:36.255
(gun fires repeatedly)

00:02:36.255 --> 00:02:39.360
(man screams)
- I don't have any money!

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:40.761
I've no money! (screams)

00:02:40.761 --> 00:02:43.928
(continues screaming)

00:02:49.477 --> 00:02:52.600
(suspenseful music)

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:53.680
- Oh my god, oh my god!

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:54.910
Thank god you guys showed up!

00:02:54.910 --> 00:02:56.153
I got to get outta here.

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:58.630
It's a silver Lexus.

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:00.380
Just pull it right up front

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:01.910
and don't scuff the paint, all right?

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:05.333
I just had it buffed.
(keys jingle)

00:03:05.333 --> 00:03:07.666
(gun fires)

00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:16.693
- Was he an alien too?
- Yep.

00:03:17.847 --> 00:03:20.597
(dramatic music)

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:26.063
(footsteps)

00:03:29.134 --> 00:03:32.301
(soft dramatic music)

00:03:42.199 --> 00:03:46.282
- There's gotta be another
human being out there.

00:03:48.055 --> 00:03:48.888
Somewhere.

00:03:58.611 --> 00:04:01.694
It's been 173 days since the undoing.

00:04:04.629 --> 00:04:06.185
(metallic scraping)

00:04:06.185 --> 00:04:09.102
Today, I may be the last man alive.

00:04:11.216 --> 00:04:15.133
However, if there is
another, I will find them.

00:04:17.352 --> 00:04:19.766
The loneliness is more than I can...

00:04:19.766 --> 00:04:22.516
(engine reeving)

00:04:23.823 --> 00:04:27.490
(man whooping and cheering)

00:04:32.876 --> 00:04:34.043
- There we go!

00:04:35.097 --> 00:04:36.343
Let me get some of that!

00:04:36.343 --> 00:04:40.801
(man groans and crunches loudly)

00:04:40.801 --> 00:04:42.926
("Non-Stop Party" by Key &amp; Peele)

00:04:42.926 --> 00:04:43.982
♪ Well, tonight we gonna party ♪

00:04:43.982 --> 00:04:45.239
Oh yeah! That's my jam
right there! (whoops)

00:04:45.239 --> 00:04:46.859
♪ And the party don't stop
because it keeps on going ♪

00:04:46.859 --> 00:04:49.852
(metallic scraping)
Huzzah!

00:04:49.852 --> 00:04:51.480
She'll take ya!

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:52.769
Just like that!

00:04:52.769 --> 00:04:55.229
Ooh, no not the butt though.

00:04:55.229 --> 00:04:57.179
(smacks lips) Milady.

00:04:57.179 --> 00:04:59.842
- Yo! Hey dude, how you doing?

00:04:59.842 --> 00:05:01.262
- Yeah!

00:05:01.262 --> 00:05:06.112
Oh yeah baby! (groans)

00:05:07.518 --> 00:05:08.959
♪ ...All night ♪

00:05:08.959 --> 00:05:11.142
♪ Friday night every night ♪

00:05:11.142 --> 00:05:11.975
Oh hey!

00:05:11.975 --> 00:05:13.212
Dude!

00:05:13.212 --> 00:05:15.647
Hey, I'll come over there!

00:05:15.647 --> 00:05:16.480
Dude, hey!

00:05:17.455 --> 00:05:19.327
I'll come to you man!

00:05:19.327 --> 00:05:21.660
(gun fires)

00:05:22.735 --> 00:05:27.568
(gun fires)
(music stops)

00:05:32.977 --> 00:05:34.622
(soft dramatic music)

00:05:34.622 --> 00:05:39.339
- There's gotta be another
human being out there.

00:05:39.339 --> 00:05:40.172
Somewhere.

00:05:41.844 --> 00:05:43.382
- [Voice Over Radio] The
zombies have broken through!

00:05:43.382 --> 00:05:44.912
I repeat, zombies!

00:05:44.912 --> 00:05:46.675
(man screams)

00:05:46.675 --> 00:05:49.175
- Oh my god, Tommy's been bit!

00:05:50.776 --> 00:05:54.026
(slow distorted music)

00:06:00.304 --> 00:06:02.137
- Ah damn!
- Oh my god!

00:06:03.391 --> 00:06:05.173
(men screaming)
Damn it! No, no!

00:06:05.173 --> 00:06:06.006
- What are you waiting for?

00:06:06.006 --> 00:06:07.687
You know what you have to do!

00:06:07.687 --> 00:06:08.860
- No, I can't do it.

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:09.869
- [Bitten Man] Do what?

00:06:09.869 --> 00:06:11.578
- You have to do it.

00:06:11.578 --> 00:06:12.745
He's been bit!

00:06:14.835 --> 00:06:15.930
(gun cocks)
- No, no, no, no!

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:16.880
- Forgive me Tommy!

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:18.233
- No, no, no, no!

00:06:18.233 --> 00:06:20.621
(man screams)

00:06:20.621 --> 00:06:21.789
(gun fires)

00:06:21.789 --> 00:06:24.956
(man pants and gasps)

00:06:27.315 --> 00:06:32.315
- (sobs softly) I can't
believe the zombies bit him!

00:06:33.492 --> 00:06:35.792
- It wasn't a zombie
(sobs), it was a raccoon!

00:06:44.331 --> 00:06:46.700
It's...the zombies are raccoons, right?

00:06:47.744 --> 00:06:50.787
(thunder rumbles softly)

00:06:50.787 --> 00:06:52.620
No? It's just zombies?

00:06:54.655 --> 00:06:57.221
(thunder rumbles)
(electricity crackles)

00:06:57.221 --> 00:06:59.831
Oh (beep), you just killed Tommy.

00:06:59.831 --> 00:07:04.450
(dramatic music)
(guns cock)

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:05.820
- All right, listen up,

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.640
sheriff's department is close
by, we'll be safe there.

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:09.363
- Okay.
- Stay close.

00:07:10.254 --> 00:07:11.943
I'll get you out of here.

00:07:11.943 --> 00:07:15.474
(zombies snarling)
(man screaming)

00:07:15.474 --> 00:07:19.812
(men screaming continuously)

00:07:19.812 --> 00:07:20.717
- Oh my god!

00:07:20.717 --> 00:07:21.795
They got Brett!

00:07:21.795 --> 00:07:23.625
- What?
- They got Brett!

00:07:23.625 --> 00:07:25.064
They got Brett!
- They didn't get us.

00:07:25.064 --> 00:07:26.770
They didn't get us, okay?

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:29.250
We're still alive, but keep it together.

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:30.083
- Yeah, okay.

00:07:30.083 --> 00:07:31.298
- We gotta make it to
that sheriff's station.

00:07:31.298 --> 00:07:32.131
- Right.

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:37.183
Oh my god.
(zombies snarling)

00:07:39.109 --> 00:07:42.276
(bell tolling softly)

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:50.993
- We got to go through them.

00:07:50.993 --> 00:07:54.710
Just stay together, keep
moving, and don't get bit.

00:07:54.710 --> 00:07:55.543
Go!

00:07:55.543 --> 00:07:58.053
(suspenseful music)
(zombies snarling)

00:07:58.053 --> 00:08:00.553
(men panting)

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:07.983
Are you getting this?

00:08:07.983 --> 00:08:09.050
- Yeah, what is up?

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.133
All right, just go.

00:08:13.806 --> 00:08:18.806
This is crazy.
(zombies continue snarling)

00:08:20.045 --> 00:08:20.878
What...

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:27.570
- Ain't that some (beep).

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:30.640
- These are some racist
mother (beep) zombies.

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:32.220
- Why would you even lock the door?

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:33.538
I mean the windows broken and...

00:08:33.538 --> 00:08:35.004
(zombie snarls)
(man gasps)

00:08:35.004 --> 00:08:37.290
- Oh, hell no...
- That's...

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:38.326
- No, no, no.

00:08:38.326 --> 00:08:41.182
(suspenseful music)
(zombies snarling)

00:08:41.182 --> 00:08:43.310
Oh, come on!

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:44.143
- What is that?

00:08:44.143 --> 00:08:46.380
- They seriously wouldn't let her eat us.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.373
- Hey guys!

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:49.870
Isn't this great?

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:52.440
These racist zombies are leaving us alone.

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:53.790
Come on, we having a party.

00:08:56.862 --> 00:08:58.740
("Party in the Mission"
by Latin Soul Syndicate)

00:08:58.740 --> 00:08:59.590
The beer is here!

00:09:02.124 --> 00:09:03.396
And look who I brought!

00:09:03.396 --> 00:09:04.373
Come on, man.

00:09:04.373 --> 00:09:06.555
(party-goers cheer)

00:09:06.555 --> 00:09:08.304
♪ There's a party in the mission ♪

00:09:08.304 --> 00:09:11.357
♪ There is only one condition ♪

00:09:11.357 --> 00:09:15.024
(zombie snarling fearfully)

00:09:20.087 --> 00:09:25.087
("Key and Peele Theme
Song" by Reggie Watts)

00:09:25.547 --> 00:09:27.690
♪ All I want, yeah ♪

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:29.817
♪ But I don't need, yuh ♪

